or-label sector-content-layer">Pharmaceuticals &amp; Life Sciences</div><h3 class="sector-content-layer">OT security transformation across global R&amp;D and manufacturing</h3><p class="sector-content-layer">Held delivery, architecture and advisory responsibilities across major pharmaceutical environments, supporting global R&amp;D, laboratories and manufacturing OT. Work included network segmentation and firewall lockdown, secure remote access, vulnerability management, asset visibility, identity and endpoint controls, third-party risk, security tooling, governance and leadership reporting.</p><div class="sector-tags sector-content-layer"><span>Global R&amp;D</span><span>Manufacturing OT</span><span>Segmentation</span><span>Third-Party Risk</span></div></article><article class="card sector-feature">
