<div class="sector-label sector-content-layer">Manufacturing &amp; FMCG</div>
<h3 class="sector-content-layer">OT architecture, risk and resilience across manufacturing environments</h3>
<p class="sector-content-layer">Delivered manufacturing OT assessments and security improvement across food, beverage and FMCG environments. Experience includes security posture and gap assessment, IEC 62443-3-2 risk assessment, IT/OT segmentation and iDMZ design, firewall modernisation, asset visibility, threat detection, vulnerability assessment and practical remediation roadmaps for operational sites.</p>
