<div class="sector-label sector-content-layer">Product Security &amp; CRA</div>
<h3 class="sector-content-layer">Product security assurance and Cyber Resilience Act readiness</h3>
<p class="sector-content-layer">Supports product and system suppliers in assessing cybersecurity capability, clarifying CRA applicability and strengthening evidence across the secure development lifecycle. Experience includes IEC 62443-2-4 maturity review, IEC 62443-4-1 secure product development, IEC 62443-4-2 component security requirements, vulnerability management, incident response, backup and recovery, and readiness for structured assurance and pre-audit review.</p>
